{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111309","id":2888676777,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6sLbWp","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111309","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111309.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111309.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111309","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111309/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111309/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111309/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/bf898d1bb7bfadb98e7ae60e7d76d02920f7d694","number":111309,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Disconnect `ScriptEditor` script list from `tree_changed` signal","user":{"login":"kitbdev","id":10054226,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDU0MjI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10054226?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev","html_url":"https://github.com/kitbdev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"ScriptEditor does not need to be connected to `tree_changed`.\r\n`_update_script_names` is called everywhere that the script list actually needs to update, when a script opens / moves / closes, or on filesystem update, etc.\r\n\r\nIt was needed to update on scene change for `highlight_scene_scripts`. But that can be handled better than just using `tree_changed`.\r\nNow on scene change/add it connects to `script_changed` on every node in the scene, so it can update when needed.\r\nThis also makes it update immediately in some cases it didn't before, like when undoing adding/removing a script.\r\n\r\nAlso removed the `_go_to_tab` call in `_update_script_names`. It only happened when sorting, but sorting does not change which is selected, so it isn't needed.\r\nIn https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/63741 it was changed to `_go_to_tab` just to make sure the member outline updated due to the `tree_changed` signal and how it used `waiting_update_names` to prevent the member outline update https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/47030\r\nWhen it was originally added, TabContainer did not have a `move_child_notify` so it probably didn't update `current_tab` correctly, and calling `set_current_tab` twice was used to fix it. #12869  https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/9126a2072c728fcde7b09e083ae979c1c678e8ea/scene/gui/tab_container.h\r\n\r\nWith `--debug-canvas-item-redraw` you can see the script list updating every time the scene tree changes, like with every tooltip that opens anywhere in the editor.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ